<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="OBA" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Abdias</para>
  <para style="toc1">ABDIAS</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abdias</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ab</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABDIAS</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="OBA 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="OBA 1:1"/>Vizyon Abdias la. Konsa pale Senyè BONDYE a konsènan Édom. Nou te tande yon rapò soti nan SENYÈ a, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:2">És 18:2</ref></char></note>mesaje te voye pami nasyon yo. Li t ap di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:4">Jr 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="JER 6:5">5</ref> </char></note>“Leve, annou ale goumen kont li”— <verse eid="OBA 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="OBA 1:2"/>Gade byen, Mwen va fè ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 24:18">Nonb 24:18</ref> </char></note> vin piti pami nasyon yo. Ou vin meprize anpil. <verse eid="OBA 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="OBA 1:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:6">És 16:6</ref> </char></note>Awogans a kè nou te twonpe nou, nou menm ki rete nan falèz wòch yo, nan wotè a abitasyon nou, ki di nan kè nou: “Se kilès ki ka rale m rive atè?” <verse eid="OBA 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="OBA 1:4"/>“Menmsi nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 20:6">Job 20:6</ref>,<ref loc="JOB 20:7">7</ref></char></note>bati anlè tankou èg, menmsi nou mete nich nou pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:12-15">És 14:12-15</ref> </char></note>zetwal yo, mwen va rale nou fè nou desann soti la,” deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="OBA 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="OBA 1:5"/>Si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:9">Jr 49:9</ref></char></note>vòlè te vin kote nou, vòlè nan lannwit yo— o ala devaste nou va vin devaste— èske yo pa t ap vòlè sèlman pou yo ta jwenn ase? Si ranmasè rezen yo te rive kote nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:21">Det 24:21</ref> </char></note>èske yo pa t ap kite kèk ti rès? <verse eid="OBA 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="OBA 1:6"/>Ala depouye Ésaü va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:10">Jr 49:10</ref> </char></note>depouye! Ala fouye yo va fouye trezò kache li yo! <verse eid="OBA 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="OBA 1:7"/>Tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:14">Jr 30:14</ref></char></note>sila ki fè alyans avèk nou yo va voye nou kote fwontyè a. Sila ki anpè ak nou yo te twonpe nou, e yo deja genyen nou. Zanmi ki manje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sòm 41:9</ref> </char></note>pen nou yo ap fè pèlen pou nou. Nanpwen bon konprann nan li.<verse eid="OBA 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="OBA 1:8"/>Èske Mwen p ap nan jou sa a, deklare SENYÈ a; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:12-14">Job 5:12-14</ref> </char></note>“Detwi mesye saj Édom yo, e retire bon konprann ki soti sou mòn Ésaü a? <verse eid="OBA 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="OBA 1:9"/>Answit, mesye pwisan nou yo va vin enkyete, O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 36:11">Jen 36:11</ref> </char></note>Théman, jis tout kapab koupe retire nèt de mòn Ésaü ak gwo masak. <verse eid="OBA 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="OBA 1:10"/>Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:41">Jen 27:41</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:9">Éz 35:9</ref> </char></note>vyolans anvè frè nou Jacob, nou va vin kouvri ak wont, e nou va vin koupe retire nèt jis pou tout tan. <verse eid="OBA 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="OBA 1:11"/>Nan jou ke nou te kanpe a distans, nan jou ke etranje yo te bwote tout byen li, lòt nasyon yo te antre nan pòtay li, e te fè tiraj osò pou Jérusalem—nou menm tou te sanble ak yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:5">Sòm 83:5</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 83:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 35:10">Éz 35:10</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="OBA 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="OBA 1:12"/>Pa vin rejwi ou nan jou malè frè ou a, ni pa rejwi ou sou fis a Juda yo nan jou destriksyon yo a. Pa anfle ou menm nan jou malè yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">És 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:11">Mi 4:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="OBA 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="OBA 1:13"/>Pa antre nan pòtay pèp Mwen an nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 35:5">Éz 35:5</ref></char></note>jou malè yo. Ni pa rejwi ou de gwo dega nan jou malè yo. Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:2">Éz 36:2</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 36:3">3</ref> </char></note>piyaje byen yo nan jou malè yo. <verse eid="OBA 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="OBA 1:14"/>Pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 16:3">És 16:3</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 16:4">4</ref> </char></note>kanpe nan kafou chemen pou touye sila k ap sove ale sòti nan yo. Epi pa livre a lènmi sila ki chape nan jou malè yo. <verse eid="OBA 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="OBA 1:15"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 30:3">Éz 30:3</ref> </char></note>jou SENYÈ a ap rapwoche sou tout nasyon yo! Jan ou te fè a, se konsa yo va fè ou. <verse eid="OBA 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="OBA 1:16"/>Paske menm jan ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:12">Jr 49:12</ref> </char></note>bwè sou mòn sen Mwen an, Konsa tout nasyon yo va bwè tout tan. Yo va bwè, yo va vale, l ap vin konsi yo pa t janm te la. <verse eid="OBA 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="OBA 1:17"/>Men sou mòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 4:2">És 4:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 4:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:1">És 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 14:2">2</ref> </char></note>Sion, va genyen sila ki chape yo, e mòn sa va sen. Epi lakay Jacob va posede posesyon yo. <verse eid="OBA 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="OBA 1:18"/>Answit, lakay Jacob va vin yon dife, e lakay Joseph va vin yon flanm; men lakay Ésaü va vin kon pay. Konsa, yo va limen dife sou yo pou brile yo nèt pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 11:23">Jr 11:23</ref> </char></note>pa gen ki rete lakay Ésaü ankò,” paske SENYÈ a fin pale.<verse eid="OBA 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="OBA 1:19"/>Moun Negev la va vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:14">És 11:14</ref> </char></note>posede mòn a Ésaü ak sila a Schfela yo, gwo plèn Philistie a. Yo va posede teritwa Éphraïm, teritwa Samarie, e Benjamin va vin posede Galaad, tou. <verse eid="OBA 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="OBA 1:20"/>Epi egzile a lame fis Israël sa a, ki pami Kananeyen yo, va posede jis rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:9">I Wa 17:9</ref></char></note>Sarepta, e egzile Jérusalem ki Sepharad yo va vin posede <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:44">Jr 32:44</ref> </char></note>vil Negev yo. <verse eid="OBA 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="OBA 1:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:27">Né 9:27</ref> </char></note>Liberatè yo va monte Mòn Sion pou jije mòn Ésaü a e wayòm nan va vin pou a SENYÈ a.<verse eid="OBA 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="OBA 1"/>
</usx>
